// The TNG factions as diplomacy SIDES, authored declaratively.
//
// Declared from //shared/signal/create_sides in __init__.mast, the same route LM uses, so
// they exist before player ships and before any map runs.
//
// A side is NOT the same thing as the faction name on a hull. shipData `side` (and
// `origin`, and therefore `race`) says what a ship IS - it is how a prefab finds "a Klingon
// warship" and how taunts are looked up. THIS file says who shoots whom. They share names
// here because that reads better, not because the systems are the same.
//
// You do not have to use these. LM's fleet spawner puts raiders on the shared "raider"
// side by default, and that keeps working with TNG hulls. These matter when you want the
// factions to be diplomatically distinct - a Cardassian ceasefire while the Dominion keeps
// firing - which is what fleet_create(..., faction_side=True) is for.
//
// Relations are declared from BOTH ends deliberately. The engine's table is DIRECTIONAL
// (colouring looks up viewer-side -> contact-side), and although side_set_relations mirrors
// each pair for you, LM's sides.amd carries the same duplication and its comment warns not
// to "tidy it up" as redundant. Do not.

# [Federation](federation)
---
Color: #07F
Enemies: players, *
---
The United Federation of Planets.

# [Klingon](klingon)
---
Color: #C30
Enemies: players, *
---
The Klingon Empire. Hostile here because the mod fields them as a raiding faction; a
mission that wants the TNG-era alliance can flip it with side_set_relations.

# [Romulan](romulan)
---
Color: #0A6
Enemies: players, *
---
The Romulan Star Empire.

# [Cardassian](cardassian)
---
Color: #B93
Allies: dominion, breen
Enemies: players, *
---
The Cardassian Union.

# [Kazon](kazon)
---
Color: #A63
Enemies: players, *
---
The Kazon sects.

# [Orion](orion)
---
Color: #9C3
Enemies: players, *
---
The Orion Syndicate.

# [Dominion](dominion)
---
Color: #96C
Allies: cardassian, breen
Enemies: players, *
---
The Dominion.

# [Breen](breen)
---
Color: #6AC
Allies: dominion, cardassian
Enemies: players, *
---
The Breen Confederacy, fighting alongside the Dominion.

# [Borg](borg)
---
Color: #0D4
Enemies: players, *
---
The Borg Collective. Hostile to everyone including the other TNG factions - there is no
`Allies:` line here and that is the point. The Dominion and the Cardassians have a
relationship; the Borg have a shipping manifest.
